Form Dict: {'doc': '{"name":"GCIHS/UNKNOWN/25/0003","owner":"Administrator","creation":"2025-01-27 11:28:38.002967","modified":"2025-01-27 11:28:38.002967","modified_by":"Administrator","docstatus":0,"idx":0,"sender":"Administrator","amended_from":null,"custom_to":"Chief Executive Officer","custom_cc":"Executive Director","date":"2025-01-27 11:27:51","custom_reference_":"GCIHS/UNKNOWN/25/0003","custom_subject":"REQUEST FOR FUNDS TOWARDS PURCHASE OF MATERIALS FOR THE IT INFRASTRUCTURE SETUP AT ABC","custom_content":"<div class=\\"ql-editor read-mode\\"><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><strong style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">I kindly request approval for the above subject. The Department plans to implement a comprehensive network infrastructure to enhance connectivity, security, and administrative efficiency at ABC and PAC Campus’. This plan aims to deploy and integrate the following systems:</strong></p><ol><li data-list=\\"bullet\\" style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span class=\\"ql-ui\\" contenteditable=\\"false\\"></span><strong style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Wired (ICT Lab) and Wireless Network (Staff/Others)</strong></li><li data-list=\\"bullet\\" class=\\"ql-indent-1\\" style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span class=\\"ql-ui\\" contenteditable=\\"false\\"></span><strong style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">This is to provide connectivity to the internet and other relevant resources on the network including files shares, potential student videos and resources through structured repositories like kolibri and shared printers whilst enhancing performance of administrative duties.</strong></li></ol><p><br></p><ol><li data-list=\\"bullet\\" style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span class=\\"ql-ui\\" contenteditable=\\"false\\"></span><strong style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Surveillance System (CCTV)</strong></li><li data-list=\\"bullet\\" class=\\"ql-indent-1\\" style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span class=\\"ql-ui\\" contenteditable=\\"false\\"></span><strong style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">This is to provide video surveillance of activities in classes and on campus for remote viewing and management thereby enhancing security.</strong></li></ol><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><strong style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">&nbsp;</strong></p><ol><li data-list=\\"bullet\\" style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span class=\\"ql-ui\\" contenteditable=\\"false\\"></span><strong style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Attendance Tracking Terminal</strong></li><li data-list=\\"bullet\\" class=\\"ql-indent-1\\" style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span class=\\"ql-ui\\" contenteditable=\\"false\\"></span><strong style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">This is essential for tracking staff attendance and/or reporting.</strong></li></ol><p><br></p><ol><li data-list=\\"bullet\\" style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span class=\\"ql-ui\\" contenteditable=\\"false\\"></span><strong style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">File Sharing Server</strong></li><li data-list=\\"bullet\\" class=\\"ql-indent-1\\" style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span class=\\"ql-ui\\" contenteditable=\\"false\\"></span><strong style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">This is to ensure a common but secure remote space for storing and sharing official work files and documents. This is essentially a remote pc where staff, students and other authorized users may access, share and store work related files</strong></li></ol><p><br></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><strong style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">With the full plan implemented, the underlisted outcomes may be realized.</strong></p><ol><li data-list=\\"bullet\\" style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span class=\\"ql-ui\\" contenteditable=\\"false\\"></span><strong style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Enhanced campus-wide connectivity and security.</strong></li><li data-list=\\"bullet\\" style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span class=\\"ql-ui\\" contenteditable=\\"false\\"></span><strong style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Efficient and credible attendance tracking and file sharing</strong></li><li data-list=\\"bullet\\" style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span class=\\"ql-ui\\" contenteditable=\\"false\\"></span><strong style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Streamlined academic and administrative operations through the school management system</strong></li></ol><p><br></p><p><strong style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">With the above in scope, the underlisted materials would be required.</strong></p><p><br></p><table class=\\"table table-bordered\\"><tbody><tr><td data-row=\\"1\\" style=\\"text-align: center;\\"><strong style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">ABC</strong></td><td data-row=\\"1\\"><br></td><td data-row=\\"1\\"><br></td><td data-row=\\"1\\"><br></td><td data-row=\\"1\\"><br></td><td data-row=\\"1\\"><br></td><td data-row=\\"1\\"><br></td></tr><tr><td data-row=\\"3\\" style=\\"text-align: center;\\"><strong style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">ITEM</strong></td><td data-row=\\"3\\" style=\\"text-align: center;\\"><strong style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">DESCRIPTION</strong></td><td data-row=\\"3\\" style=\\"text-align: center;\\"><strong style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">SERVICE AREA</strong></td><td data-row=\\"3\\" style=\\"text-align: center;\\"><strong style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">QTY</strong></td><td data-row=\\"3\\" style=\\"text-align: center;\\"><strong style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);